      "side": 1,
      "message": "If you want to go this route, please add a new parameter to the function instead (`save_rtc` or something), it\u0027s not guaranteed that __idle will set a delay_us !\u003d 0 (in the unlikely case where next_delay \u003d\u003d STOP_MODE_LATENCY).\n\nBut IMHO all this logic should be in __idle.",
